 "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5473.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "(He is) the Knower of the Unseen, and He revealeth unto none His secret,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O bütün gaybı bilir. Fakat gaybını hiç kimseye açmaz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "غیب کا جاننے والا تو اپنے غیب پر کسی کو مسلط نہیں کرتا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(Dia adalah Tuhan) Yang Mengetahui yang ghaib, maka Dia tidak memperlihatkan kepada seorangpun tentang yang ghaib itu.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "عَٰلِمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْغَيْبِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُظْهِرُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/0de7f26f602086728cfb.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "otkriva", "en": "He reveals", "tr": "açığa çıkarır", "fr": "Il révèle", "id": "Dia menampakkan", "ur": "وہ ظاہر کرتا ہے", "bn": "তিনি প্রকাশ করেন", "fa": "آشکار می‌کند"}}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "غَيْبِهِۦٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَحَدًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "30:18", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3427.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Unto Him be praise in the heavens and the earth! - and at the sun's decline and in the noonday.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Göklerde ve yerde, ikindileyin de, öğleye erdiğiniz zaman da hamd O'na mahsustur.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اسی کی تعریف ہے آسمانوں اور زمین میں اور کچھ دن رہے اور جب تمہیں دوپہر ہو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan bagi-Nya-lah segala puji di langit dan di bumi dan di waktu kamu berada pada petang hari dan di waktu kamu berada di waktu Zuhur.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْحَمْدُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَعَشِيًّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَحِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُظْهِرُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/bcce63326ff18fe98abb.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) reach noon", "bs": "ulazite u podne", "tr": "öğle vaktine girersiniz", "fr": "vous atteignez midi", "id": "kalian sampai tengah hari", "ur": "تم سب دوپہر کو پہنچتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা দুপুরে পৌঁছাও", "fa": "به نیمروز می‌رسید"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "لِيُظْهِرَهُۥ", "count": 3, "first": "9:33", "audio": "audio/d95a6192642acad34d96.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "so that he/it may make it prevail", "bs": "da ga učini nadmoćnim", "tr": "onu üstün kılsın diye", "fr": "qu'il le rende victorieux", "id": "agar dia menjadikannya unggul", "ur": "تاکہ وہ اسے غالب کرے", "bn": "যাতে সে তাকে প্রবল করে", "fa": "تا آن را چیره گرداند"}}, {"arabic": "تُظْهِرُونَ", "count": 1, "first": "30:18", "audio": "audio/bcce63326ff18fe98abb.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) reach noon", "bs": "ulazite u podne", "tr": "öğle vaktine girersiniz", "fr": "vous atteignez midi", "id": "kalian sampai tengah hari", "ur": "تم سب دوپہر کو پہنچتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা দুপুরে পৌঁছাও", "fa":